<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results on the 12th</p>
<p>day of the French Open tennis tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>16-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Patrick Rafter (Australia) 6-7</p>
<p>(6-8) 6-1 7-5 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 6-1 3-6</p>
<p>6-1 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>(Ends men's results)</p>
</text>
